RoboTok project page
====================

The page itself -- index.html, static/css/index.css, static/js/index.js,
serve.py and README.md -- is licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License (CC BY-SA 4.0).

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode

ShareAlike is not our choice to make: the layout began from the Nerfies project
page template, which is CC BY-SA 4.0, so anything derived from it inherits the
same terms.

    Nerfies project page template
    https://github.com/nerfies/nerfies.github.io
    Copyright (c) 2021 Keunhong Park and the Nerfies authors
    CC BY-SA 4.0


Third-party components
----------------------

Bulma -- static/css/bulma.min.css, and the layout classes the page uses
    MIT License. Copyright (c) 2023 Jeremy Thomas.
    https://bulma.io/ | https://github.com/jgthms/bulma

Noto Sans -- static/fonts/noto-sans-*.woff2
    SIL Open Font License 1.1.
    https://fonts.google.com/noto/specimen/Noto+Sans
    https://openfontlicense.org/
    Subsetted to latin, latin-ext and greek; otherwise unmodified.

Noto Sans is the only face the page sets. Earlier revisions led the display
stack with 'Google Sans', which is Google's proprietary brand font and not part
of the open google/fonts collection; it has been removed rather than shipped,
so every reader sees the same typography and the page requests no font from a
third party.
